# The example app's own native Android/iOS/web scaffolding is real
# (flutter create-generated) and needed for anyone cloning/running the
# example locally, but it's not needed inside the published package tarball
# — pub.dev consumers get the example's white_label.yaml/lib/tenants/README
# without paying for Gradle wrapper jars, Xcode project files, etc.
# See README's "Remaining work before v1.0.0" — flagged by an audit as
# real, verified tarball bloat.
example/example_app/android/
example/example_app/ios/
example/example_app/web/
example/example_app/*.iml
example/example_app/pubspec.lock
